<title>USA: Maverick Tube Corp Q4 Sept 30 profit.</title>
<headline>Maverick Tube Corp Q4 Sept 30 profit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except and per share data)</p>
<p>				    Fourth Quarter	Year Ended</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995	   1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales	     $62,115   $46,412	$204,182  $167,896</p>
<p> Gross profit	    6,960     1,916	  22,140     8,031</p>
