<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 net sales, income hurt by revenue deferral resulting from the cessation of recording revenue on material stored for customers. This cut net sales by $8.8 million, gross profit by $1.0 million and net income by $839,000. Fiscal 1996 earnings per share exclude $0.11 in net income associated with cessation of recording revenue on material stored for customers.</p>
